DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9646::$$$message_0073_0000_0000$$$::The gust of wind blows up the dry dust into the air.[lr]::
9647::$$$message_0073_0000_0001$$$::The morning practice must've finished, as there are not many people.[lr]::
9648::$$$message_0073_0000_0002$$$::Just as I was about to turn back,[lr]::
9649::$$$message_0073_0000_0003$$$::"All right! Found the handyman!"[cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01c(中)][wvs][wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=200 pos=c accel=3 storage=蒔寺制服01c(中)][se storage=se089.wav][wm canskip=0][lr]::
9650::$$$message_0073_0000_0004$$$::...She comes running, talking in a rude manner.::
9651::$$$message_0073_0001_0000$$$::"What, Makidera? Did you break equipment again while creating a new track event?"[lr]::
9652::$$$message_0073_0001_0001$$$::"Wrench head! You can repair something no matter how many times it breaks, but a lost life won't return a second time!"::
9653::$$$message_0073_0002_0000$$$::"...Putting that nickname aside.[lr]::
9654::$$$message_0073_0002_0001$$$::That's not for someone who only breaks things to say. Fixing them is a pain too... Hey wait, what are you pulling at?"[lr]::
9655::$$$message_0073_0002_0002$$$::"Stop babbling! I don't want to have to ask for your help either, but this is no time to be bringing personal feelings into this!"::
9656::$$$message_0073_0003_0000$$$::"Makidera. What kind of way of talking is that when you had me not only fix the track club equipment but even your own rice cooker?"[lr]::
9657::$$$message_0073_0003_0001$$$::"Rice scoop head![lr]::
9658::$$$message_0073_0003_0002$$$::If you have time to delve into the past like that, then scoop the fleeting possibility called life!"::
9659::$$$message_0073_0004_0000$$$::"...[lr]::
9660::$$$message_0073_0004_0001$$$::Life? What are you talking about?"[lr]::
9661::$$$message_0073_0004_0002$$$::"She might die!"[lr]::
9662::$$$message_0073_0004_0003$$$::"What!?"[lr]::
9663::$$$message_0073_0004_0004$$$::"This is vexing, but you're the only one who can save her!"::
9664::$$$message_0073_0005_0000$$$::"Whattt?"[lr]::
9665::$$$message_0073_0005_0001$$$::I can't keep quiet if she's asking me to save a life.[lr]::
9666::$$$message_0073_0005_0002$$$::Kaede Makidera is formidable.[lr]::
9667::$$$message_0073_0005_0003$$$::Did she sense the man that will eventually become the champion of justice with that sense of smell!?::
9668::$$$message_0073_0006_0000$$$::"Okay, lead me there![lr]::
9669::$$$message_0073_0006_0001$$$::Even if it means that the neck of a Peeps marshmallow came off, or that your neck will fall off if I don't give you my English homework until tomorrow!"[lr]::
9670::$$$message_0073_0006_0002$$$::"Fine, such business is a daily occurrence![lr]::
9671::$$$message_0073_0006_0003$$$::But, that'll be for another time!"::
9672::$$$message_0073_0007_0000$$$::"[move textoff=0 time=150 path=(292,152,255)(274,142,255)(255,152,255)(242,141,255)(226,155,255)(220,142,255) storage=由紀香制服01c(遠) accel=0]Agh...ugh...[cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01e(遠)][wvl][wm canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=由紀香制服01e(遠)][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(243,153,255)(260,141,255)(281,157,255)(299,144,255)(314,156,255)(331,142,255)(357,157,255)(373,142,255)(401,156,255)(419,141,255) storage=由紀香制服01e(遠) accel=0]ahh...[cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01d(遠)][wvl][wm canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=由紀香制服01d(遠)]oh,[wvl canskip=0 time=200][move textoff=0 time=100 path=(419,151,255)(430,141,255)(431,152,255) storage=由紀香制服01d(遠) accel=0] Maki!"[lr]::
9673::$$$message_0073_0007_0001$$$::"Wha[line len=3][wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3]wait, it was true!?[lr]::
9674::$$$message_0073_0007_0002$$$::The one that was dying was Saegusa!?"[lr]::
9675::$$$message_0073_0007_0003$$$::"Oh, Emiya."[lr]::
9676::$$$message_0073_0007_0004$$$::"Shaking your body like that... Where does it hurt?"[lr]::
9677::$$$message_0073_0007_0005$$$::"Huh?"::
9678::$$$message_0073_0008_0000$$$::"No, not me. Look, up there..."[lr]::
9679::$$$message_0073_0008_0001$$$::When I look at what she's pointing at...[wait canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se670.wav][lr]::
9680::$$$message_0073_0008_0002$$$::A calico kitten is snug and curled up in a tree.::
9681::$$$message_0073_0009_0000$$$::"The one who noticed was Yukika... It seems like that kitten can't get down."[lr]::
9682::$$$message_0073_0009_0001$$$::"What a...cliché punchline."::
9683::$$$message_0073_0010_0000$$$::"Um, Emiya, can you save it?"[lr]::
9684::$$$message_0073_0010_0001$$$::"Of course, I'll try."[lr]::
9685::$$$message_0073_0010_0002$$$::"I'm counting on you. If it's you, you might be able to reach it."[lr]::
9686::$$$message_0073_0010_0003$$$::"Hm, it's you, Himuro.[lr]::
9687::$$$message_0073_0010_0004$$$::Can't you save it if you jump? You're the ace of high jump, right?"::
9688::$$$message_0073_0011_0000$$$::"Kane isn't good with cats."[lr]::
9689::$$$message_0073_0011_0001$$$::"Yeah, we should rub the kitten onto Kane and have fun once we save it!"[lr]::
9690::$$$message_0073_0011_0002$$$::"Makino-G... Once we get the kitten down, I shall hang you from the tree instead."[lr]::
9691::$$$message_0073_0011_0003$$$::"Geez, so scary...! The horror!"::
9692::$$$message_0073_0012_0000$$$::We go right under the kitten and measure our distance.[lr]::
9693::$$$message_0073_0012_0001$$$::I am definitely the tallest out of these members.[lr]::
9694::$$$message_0073_0012_0002$$$::But even then, I can't reach the branch even if I stand on my tiptoes.[lr]::
9695::$$$message_0073_0012_0003$$$::Even if I were to climb the tree, when the trunk is this thin, the branches would shake greatly and the kitten would be flung.[lr]::
9696::$$$message_0073_0012_0004$$$::Shake the trunk and drop the kitten... Even Makidera wouldn't do such a thing.::
9697::$$$message_0073_0013_0000$$$::"Then, I'll kick the tree with all my might, so you and Yukicchi catch it when it falls."[lr]::
9698::$$$message_0073_0013_0001$$$::"Huh? Huh? [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01e(遠),由紀香制服01d(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=由紀香制服01e(遠)][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=由紀香制服01d(遠)]Huh?"::
9699::$$$message_0073_0014_0000$$$::"...I was naïve.[lr]::
9700::$$$message_0073_0014_0001$$$::Himuro, hold that idiot down."[lr]::
9701::$$$message_0073_0014_0002$$$::"Understood."[lr]::
9702::$$$message_0073_0014_0003$$$::"Woah, what are you guys doing in such an emergency!?[lr]::
9703::$$$message_0073_0014_0004$$$::Let go of the leader!"::
9704::$$$message_0073_0015_0000$$$::"If I jump..."[lr]::
9705::$$$message_0073_0015_0001$$$::If I back up from the tree a bit... One, two, three!::
9706::$$$message_0073_0016_0000$$$::"Ahh, that was close."[lr]::
9707::$$$message_0073_0016_0001$$$::"Khh!"[lr]::
9708::$$$message_0073_0016_0002$$$::I barely miss the kitten branch.[lr]::
9709::$$$message_0073_0016_0003$$$::"Heheh, [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺制服03b(中)]your height isn't enough, huh..."[lr]::
9710::$$$message_0073_0016_0004$$$::...She casually says what I'm self-conscious about.::
9711::$$$message_0073_0017_0000$$$::"Ah... There, there. Be a good kitty, we'll save you right now."[lr]::
9712::$$$message_0073_0017_0001$$$::"Mrgh, maybe I would've been able to reach it."[lr]::
9713::$$$message_0073_0017_0002$$$::"Dammit. If it comes to this, do we have to make Kane overcome her hate for cats!?"::
9714::$$$message_0073_0018_0000$$$::"As I'm holding onto Kane, you guys hammer some sweet talk about cats into her."[lr]::
9715::$$$message_0073_0018_0001$$$::"Huh? Huh? Huh?"[lr]::
9716::$$$message_0073_0018_0002$$$::"You're the one being held down..."::
9717::$$$message_0073_0019_0000$$$::"Heh, don't mind me... There's no life to hold dear at this point.[lr]::
9718::$$$message_0073_0019_0001$$$::Now, keep on telling her about your favorite body part of a cat, a cat's gesture that you think is super cute, your favorite cat manga, the results of your cat fortune telling, or what kind of cat you want to be when you're reincarnated!"::
9719::$$$message_0073_0020_0000$$$::"Hmm, I can't reach it after all."[lr]::
9720::$$$message_0073_0020_0001$$$::"Hey, don't ignore me!"[lr]::
9721::$$$message_0073_0020_0002$$$::"Did you know, Maki?[lr]::
9722::$$$message_0073_0020_0003$$$::This area used to be a graveyard and that even now anywhere you dig, human bones..."[lr]::
9723::$$$message_0073_0020_0004$$$::"I don't! [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]And I won't listen!"::
9724::$$$message_0073_0021_0000$$$::"Well, you can also use this opportunity to overcome your own flaw."[lr]::
9725::$$$message_0073_0021_0001$$$::"Which flaw are you talking about?"::
9726::$$$message_0073_0022_0000$$$::"Well, the story that the school grounds used to be a graveyard isn't rare.[lr]::
9727::$$$message_0073_0022_0001$$$::Burial grounds are cheap after all... [cacheimage storage=氷室制服02d(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(近)]Hm, could the block of stone that you're stepping on right now be a cenotaph?"[lr]::
9728::$$$message_0073_0022_0002$$$::"I-I-I-I'm not stepping on it![lr]::
9729::$$$message_0073_0022_0003$$$::Don't casually change the topic! [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服04b(近)][wvl][wshock canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=蒔寺制服04b(近)]Also ghosts don't come out during the day!"::
9730::$$$message_0073_0023_0000$$$::"But there's been an increase in reports of ghost sightings at noon lately.[lr]::
9731::$$$message_0073_0023_0001$$$::Word has it that the ghost of a beautiful woman with long hair holding a parcel the size of an urn suddenly appears and disappears along with the neigh of a horse..."::
9732::$$$message_0073_0024_0000$$$::"No! That's probably the sister or mom of a student kindly delivering their lunch to school! While riding a horse![lr]::
9733::$$$message_0073_0024_0001$$$::Stop suspecting such a warming beautiful story with your hardened heart!"[lr]::
9734::$$$message_0073_0024_0002$$$::...It's a random guess but probably right.::
9735::$$$message_0073_0025_0000$$$::"Maki, if you make such a fuss, the kitten will get scared."[lr]::
9736::$$$message_0073_0025_0001$$$::"Yeah. Can't you do something about that, Makidera?"[lr]::
9737::$$$message_0073_0025_0002$$$::"That's why I pulled her away.[lr]::
9738::$$$message_0073_0025_0003$$$::But, she ran away, and came back with you."::
9739::$$$message_0073_0026_0000$$$::"Dammit, I shouldn't have relied on Emiya."[lr]::
9740::$$$message_0073_0026_0001$$$::...[lr]::
9741::$$$message_0073_0026_0002$$$::I can't stand being called useless by this Makidera.::
9742::$$$message_0073_0027_0000$$$::"All right..."[lr]::
9743::$$$message_0073_0027_0001$$$::"W-What happened, Emiya?"[lr]::
9744::$$$message_0073_0027_0002$$$::I get on all fours under the branch.::
9745::$$$message_0073_0028_0000$$$::"Makidera, get on top."[lr]::
9746::$$$message_0073_0028_0001$$$::"Emiya..."[lr]::
9747::$$$message_0073_0028_0002$$$::"Emiya..."[lr]::
9748::$$$message_0073_0028_0003$$$::"Emiya..."::
9749::$$$message_0073_0029_0000$$$::"If you still can't reach, then jump from my back."[lr]::
9750::$$$message_0073_0029_0001$$$::"What... Are you sure?"[lr]::
9751::$$$message_0073_0029_0002$$$::"I might not seem like much, but I do work out. I can bear this much."::
9752::$$$message_0073_0030_0000$$$::"But..."[lr]::
9753::$$$message_0073_0030_0001$$$::"The height is more certain if I carry you on my shoulders, but you are a girl after all."::
9754::$$$message_0073_0031_0000$$$::"Okay... Sorry for making you do this."[lr]::
9755::$$$message_0073_0031_0001$$$::"Don't worry about it."[lr]::
9756::$$$message_0073_0031_0002$$$::"Man, I said such mean things to you though."[lr]::
9757::$$$message_0073_0031_0003$$$::"I don't mind it."::
9758::$$$message_0073_0032_0000$$$::"I'll owe you one."[lr]::
9759::$$$message_0073_0032_0001$$$::"Yeah... Wait, take off your shoes!"[lr]::
9760::$$$message_0073_0032_0002$$$::"Take off?"[lr]::
9761::$$$message_0073_0032_0003$$$::"Why are you making such a puzzled face!?"::
9762::$$$message_0073_0033_0000$$$::As I look up, in the corner of my eye I see the dead leaves that were stacked on the ground whirl up.[lr]::
9763::$$$message_0073_0033_0001$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
9764::$$$message_0073_0033_0002$$$::Rugged shoes fall in front of my eyes.::
9765::$$$message_0073_0034_0000$$$::"Is this it, young ladies?"[lr]::
9766::$$$message_0073_0034_0001$$$::The kitten that was on the branch is in Archer's arms.::
9767::$$$message_0073_0035_0000$$$::"Wow..."[lr]::
9768::$$$message_0073_0035_0001$$$::"What...?"[lr]::
9769::$$$message_0073_0035_0002$$$::"Oh..."::
9770::$$$message_0073_0036_0000$$$::"...What are you doing here?"[lr]::
9771::$$$message_0073_0036_0001$$$::"Well, I wasn't planning on interfering, but I couldn't bear watching the uselessness."[lr]::
9772::$$$message_0073_0036_0002$$$::[font italic=true]...Humph.[font italic=false][lr]::
9773::$$$message_0073_0036_0003$$$::Then he should've played dumb and distanced himself from here.::
9774::$$$message_0073_0037_0000$$$::"Oh... [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服02b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=由紀香制服02b(近)]Thank you!"[lr]::
9775::$$$message_0073_0037_0001$$$::The calico kitten that was handed to Saegusa must've felt relieved, as it curled its body up as if it was being held by a mother cat.[lr]::
9776::$$$message_0073_0037_0002$$$::...I can't stand that guy, but thanks to Archer, the kitten was saved.::
9777::$$$message_0073_0038_0000$$$::"Um, what is your name...?"[lr]::
9778::$$$message_0073_0038_0001$$$::"It is nothing worth mentioning. I will save that for when we meet properly again."::
9779::$$$message_0073_0039_0000$$$::"Woah, how cool.[lr]::
9780::$$$message_0073_0039_0001$$$::He's like a champion of justice."[lr]::
9781::$$$message_0073_0039_0002$$$::"...[resumevoice]Mrgh?"::
9782::$$$message_0073_0040_0000$$$::"Wait. What are you saying, Makidera?"[lr]::
9783::$$$message_0073_0040_0001$$$::"I mean he is.[lr]::
9784::$$$message_0073_0040_0002$$$::He appears like the wind and saves the weak."[lr]::
9785::$$$message_0073_0040_0003$$$::"Yes, and with a big heart that he doesn't boast about."[lr]::
9786::$$$message_0073_0040_0004$$$::"He's lovely, like the main character of a period drama."::
9787::$$$message_0073_0041_0000$$$::"...That is not very good.[lr]::
9788::$$$message_0073_0041_0001$$$::You should avoid using the expression 'champion of justice.'[lr]::
9789::$$$message_0073_0041_0002$$$::Look, a strong sense of justice would also create strong enemies at the same time.[lr]::
9790::$$$message_0073_0041_0003$$$::What is waiting at the end of that is a bloody war of attrition. Conflict will only be created if you are not neutral and moderate.[lr]::
9791::$$$message_0073_0041_0004$$$::Understand, young ladies? It is good to be particular about things, but it is not good to be thorough."::
9792::$$$message_0073_0042_0000$$$::"Um... Okay. Are you saying that it's not good to excel in only one skill?"[lr]::
9793::$$$message_0073_0042_0001$$$::"No, it's not about skill, but the matter of how you think.[lr]::
9794::$$$message_0073_0042_0002$$$::A 'champion of justice' is a way of being that would only be seen as an enemy from someone who is the complete opposite[line len=2]"[lr]::
9795::$$$message_0073_0042_0003$$$::"What are you saying? Being a champion of justice is a good thing. It's cool[line len=2]everyone's role model![lr]::
9796::$$$message_0073_0042_0004$$$::Best of all, it's easy to understand!"::
9797::$$$message_0073_0043_0000$$$::"The only thing that's easy to understand is the nickname.[lr]::
9798::$$$message_0073_0043_0001$$$::The content is a mass of self-contradiction. A champion of justice is a pipe dream that those who cannot conform to society look up to.[lr]::
9799::$$$message_0073_0043_0002$$$::If there is such a thing as true righteousness, then that is a society that does not need a champion of justice. If there is evil within that, that is the ugliness of people who lament over the world that does not go their way and yearn for a champion of justice.[lr]::
9800::$$$message_0073_0043_0003$$$::...Well, how should I put it? A champion of justice is another name for human weakness."::
9801::$$$message_0073_0044_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9802::$$$message_0073_0044_0001$$$::Archer's criticism continues.[lr]::
9803::$$$message_0073_0044_0002$$$::I want to object, but as someone who couldn't save the kitten, I can only shut up and listen.::
9804::$$$message_0073_0045_0000$$$::"So you guys keep that in mind[line len=2]"::
9805::$$$message_0073_0046_0000$$$::"Haha, you don't need to be embarrassed at your age."[lr]::
9806::$$$message_0073_0046_0001$$$::"Hm, so wishing for others to speak on behalf of clear justice in itself is evil. Fascinating."[lr]::
9807::$$$message_0073_0046_0002$$$::"Here kitty, tell Mr. Champion of Justice thank you."::
9808::$$$message_0073_0047_0000$$$::"H-Hold on. Were you guys even listening?[lr]::
9809::$$$message_0073_0047_0001$$$::...It can't be helped. This'll get a little long, but this is my responsibility for saving the kitten on a whim; I shall correct you elaborately.[lr]::
9810::$$$message_0073_0047_0002$$$::Yes, for example, this kitten. It was saved by a champion of justice, so in this instance was good. However, within the hearts of some who were saved, sows a naïve thought that some miraculous existence would save them even if they ran into danger again. But that would get in the way of one's growth and progress. Has it occured to you that a champion of justice is a hypocritical and egotistical existence that is a nuisance to others[line len=2]"::
9811::$$$message_0073_0048_0000$$$::"It's a kitten; it won't understand such a difficult thing. See, it's attached to you."[lr]::
9812::$$$message_0073_0048_0001$$$::"It's the pride of a guardian. Instead of a temporary thing such as offering a hand, I believe you must offer a hand with the determination of supporting them for the rest of their life."[lr]::
9813::$$$message_0073_0048_0002$$$::"So, what's your point?[lr]::
9814::$$$message_0073_0048_0003$$$::You're the champion of justice; come on, don't be stingy and just tell us!"::
9815::$$$message_0073_0049_0000$$$::"Like I said, calling me a champion of justice is[line len=2]"[lr]::
9816::$$$message_0073_0049_0001$$$::"Well, you won't tell us what your name is, so we don't know what else to call you."[lr]::
9817::$$$message_0073_0049_0002$$$::"Even criticizing your self-criticizing attitude is even more impressive."[lr]::
9818::$$$message_0073_0049_0003$$$::"Cuteness is justice, see?"::
9819::$$$message_0073_0050_0000$$$::"Khh, quit looking at me with such innocent eyes, kitten...![lr]::
9820::$$$message_0073_0050_0001$$$::I only saved you as an interaction with an animal known as a cat; I didn't save you as an individual...!"[lr]::
9821::$$$message_0073_0050_0002$$$::"But, the cat is super attached to you!"[lr]::
9822::$$$message_0073_0050_0003$$$::"Oh, you're right. It's gotten its nails out and is clawing you."::
9823::$$$message_0073_0051_0000$$$::"Mrgh... Hey, kid.[lr]::
9824::$$$message_0073_0051_0001$$$::How about you say something? What happened to your usual foul mouth?[lr]::
9825::$$$message_0073_0051_0002$$$::You could at least say, 'How can you be liked by cats?'"[lr]::
9826::$$$message_0073_0051_0003$$$::"...Well, it's nothing.[lr]::
9827::$$$message_0073_0051_0004$$$::I don't have the right to say this and that to you when I wasn't even able to save the kitten.[lr]::
9828::$$$message_0073_0051_0005$$$::And I can see that the cat is unmistakably attached to you."[lr]::
9829::$$$message_0073_0051_0006$$$::Falling in love, I might say.::
9830::$$$message_0073_0052_0000$$$::"Guh...[cacheimage storage=アーチャー私服02c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=アーチャー私服02c(中)]there's no use talking.[lr]::
9831::$$$message_0073_0052_0001$$$::I don't have all day. I will excuse myself here.[lr]::
9832::$$$message_0073_0052_0002$$$::Young ladies, let that kitten out into the wild. If you do not let it learn its lesson, then that kitten will stay as it is."[lr]::
9833::$$$message_0073_0052_0003$$$::Archer acts sentimentally as he skulks away.::
9834::$$$message_0073_0053_0000$$$::"Oh, he left... I wonder what happened."[lr]::
9835::$$$message_0073_0053_0001$$$::"What's up with him? That red justice guy isn't friendly."[lr]::
9836::$$$message_0073_0053_0002$$$::"He must be shy. I am guessing that he wasn't in a bad mood, but was holding back a smile."::
9837::$$$message_0073_0054_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9838::$$$message_0073_0054_0001$$$::Archer left.[lr]::
9839::$$$message_0073_0054_0002$$$::He seemed to be complaining about all sorts of things, but in the end, he's the one who saved the kitten, and I couldn't do anything.::
9840::$$$message_0073_0055_0000$$$::"...Damn it, I need to train more."[lr]::
9841::$$$message_0073_0055_0001$$$::I fall to my knees.[lr]::
9842::$$$message_0073_0055_0002$$$::The sense of defeat weighs heavily on my back.::
9843::$$$message_0073_0056_0000$$$::"Heh... Hone your kung fu skills, stupid kid."[lr]::
9844::$$$message_0073_0056_0001$$$::"Um, why are you sitting on me?"[lr]::
9845::$$$message_0073_0056_0002$$$::"Well meow, I thought you wanted to lie down since you wouldn't get up at all meow." ::
9846::$$$message_0073_0057_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9847::$$$message_0073_0057_0001$$$::She's rubbing salt into the wound.[lr]::
9848::$$$message_0073_0057_0002$$$::The kitten looks at me with innocent eyes, as if cheering me on.[lr]::
9849::$$$message_0073_0057_0003$$$::Man, being pitied by a kitten... Damn, if only I had more height...!::
909765::$$$message_9073_0034_0000$$$::"Is this it, young ladies?"[r]::
